WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two targets can cross the same place on a screen within a fraction of a second.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Yet in rapid sequences, people often report the first and miss the second.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Researchers call this the attentional blink. Timing and task instructions matter.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:27.000
It is a laboratory pattern, not a diagnosis of your attention.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Some meditation research is promising. It does not establish that a commercial audio file works.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Try a free practice. Compare the actual package. Read the evidence before you buy.
